=== Test 1: Explicit column_names_to_sum with Tuple ===
Before OPTIMIZE - with FINAL:
1	(40,60)
After OPTIMIZE:
1	(40,60)
=== Test 2: Explicit column_names_to_sum with nested Tuple ===
Before OPTIMIZE - with FINAL:
1	(50,(70,90))	200
After OPTIMIZE:
1	(50,(70,90))	200
=== Test 3: Explicit column_names_to_sum - only specified Tuple is summed ===
Before OPTIMIZE - with FINAL:
1	(40,60)	(300,400)
After OPTIMIZE (not_summed should keep last value):
1	(40,60)	(300,400)
